From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:38:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 429/443] [ae-patch] Send the team and roles notice once per
 Claude session, with a one-line marker in between

The framework-context hook keeps a hash of the notice (without its per-turn Lead line) and the Claude session id, and sends the full block on the first prompt, on any change, on every 20th prompt and never twice in one turn; other prompts get a one-line marker. A new SessionStart hook clears the state and, on compact or resume, re-emits the last full block. The notice opens with "Replaces any earlier notice.", and the auto paragraph is shorter and says "this chat".
